{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":18.16},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":19.2,"end":33.52},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":35,"end":47.68}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":5.6,"text":"碰撞力學區分動量 mv 與動能 ½mv²。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.72,"end":9.04,"text":"這個一維關卡包含兩個物體，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":9.36,"end":11.52,"text":"碰撞期間沒有外部衝量。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12,"end":13.36,"text":"速度有正負號，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":13.653,"end":16.56,"text":"因此反向運動可以抵消動量，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":16.64,"end":18.16,"text":"卻不會抵消動能。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":19.2,"end":20.56,"text":"設定相同質量，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.64,"end":23.04,"text":"速度為 +2 和 −2。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.52,"end":24.88,"text":"先預測總動量，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.12,"end":27.84,"text":"再比較不為零的動能讀值。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":28.92,"end":31.68,"text":"相同質量以等速反向運動時，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":32.08,"end":33.52,"text":"總動量是多少？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":35,"end":37.92,"text":"相同質量以等速反向運動時，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":38.24,"end":39.84,"text":"總動量是多少？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":40.96,"end":44.48,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":45.04,"end":47.68,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}